{
  "version": "v0.7.9.alpha",
  "date": "September 3, 2026",
  "title": "Monthly Update by BigT",
  "content": {
    "features": [
      "Gave humans hand and armor equip slot",
      "-Made it so you can set armor and hand of human mob with /setequipment command",
      "-Humans can now equip armors (cosmetic only for now)",
      "-Set human mob space suit color with /suitcolor",
      "Made projectiles go through cage and over all tables (more things might have this in the future now)",
      "Added low wall that can be shot over but not walked through",
      "Added window and armored window",
      "Added circuit board printer which prints circuit boards from copper bars and glass at high efficiency",
      "-Circuit boards now cost 5 copper bars and 5 glass bars in furnace (subject to balancing)",
      "-Circuit boards now sell for 30 gold, making them a higher value item",
      "Added neon signs",
      "Added /setstructure command",
      "Mobs are now hid in FOV mode",
      "Floors are now rotatable which will make cool patterns accessible in non-peaceful gamemode",
      "FOV is now enabled in hardcore mode",
      "Enabled /level command and added $getLevel($entityId) function",
      "Added GoalAchieved trigger",
      "Raised speed limit in /speed and /stat",
      "From PoTATo_0",
      "Overclock can now be toggled on and off in peaceful mode. It is off by default",
      "Solar panels have a reduced capacity of 500W now and their production is 25 during the day and -50 at night"
    ],
    
    "bugs": [
      "Fix guns shooting over buildings (courtesy of Wahlee)",
      "Fill building no longer overrides floor and terrain",
      "Centered shower sprite",
      "Fixed oil refinery sprite being the wrong number of pixels",
      "Fixed small wooden table sprite",
      "Removed throwable projectiles exploding on collision",
      "Consecutive button presses of the same type now trigger PlayerKeyboard (by PoTATo_0)"
    ]
  }
}
